`Liam joins an unconnected electrical contractor` MEANS ChangeOfEmployer WITH
    `my employment with the old employer ended` IS TRUE
    `months until the new employer employed me` IS 0
    `my work is the same or substantially the same` IS TRUE
    `the connection` IS `no connection between the employers`
    `the business was transmitted before 20 June 2022` IS FALSE

`the buyer of my business takes me on a month later` MEANS ChangeOfEmployer WITH
    `my employment with the old employer ended` IS TRUE
    `months until the new employer employed me` IS 1
    `my work is the same or substantially the same` IS TRUE
    `the connection` IS `the new employer took over assets used in my work under an arrangement`
    `the business was transmitted before 20 June 2022` IS FALSE

`a related company takes me on two months later` MEANS ChangeOfEmployer WITH
    `my employment with the old employer ended` IS TRUE
    `months until the new employer employed me` IS 2
    `my work is the same or substantially the same` IS TRUE
    `the connection` IS `the new employer is a related body corporate of my old employer`
    `the business was transmitted before 20 June 2022` IS FALSE

`a related company takes me on four months later` MEANS ChangeOfEmployer WITH
    `my employment with the old employer ended` IS TRUE
    `months until the new employer employed me` IS 4
    `my work is the same or substantially the same` IS TRUE
    `the connection` IS `the new employer is a related body corporate of my old employer`
    `the business was transmitted before 20 June 2022` IS FALSE

`a business sold in 2021` MEANS ChangeOfEmployer WITH
    `my employment with the old employer ended` IS TRUE
    `months until the new employer employed me` IS 1
    `my work is the same or substantially the same` IS TRUE
    `the connection` IS `the new employer took over assets used in my work under an arrangement`
    `the business was transmitted before 20 June 2022` IS TRUE

