§§ `For the employee (the baseline's seat)`

-- Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me?
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does the Act apply to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- s 4A.
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does the Act apply to me` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- A loading is not an equivalent entitlement.
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS (`yes if` (`Does the Act apply to me` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the employer` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Does the WA Long Service Leave Act apply to me` `as the personal representative` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

